      "deletions": 0,
      "filename": "data/org.freedesktop.portal.Usb.xml",
      "patch": "@@ -17,6 +17,19 @@\n \n       This documentation describes version 1 of this interface.\n \n+      Device filtering\n+      ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n+\n+      Sandboxed apps must declare which USB devices they support ahead of\n+      time. This information is read by the XDG Desktop Portal and used to\n+      determine which USB devices will be exposed to requesting apps.\n+\n+      How to configure device filtering depends on the sandbox technology.\n+      For Flatpak, see the `USB Portal documentation\n+      <https://docs.flatpak.org/en/latest/sandbox-permissions.html#usb-portal>`_.\n+\n+      Outside of a sandbox, all devices are assumed to be allowed.\n+\n       Device identifiers\n       ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n ",
